    },
    "ヒント（残り%lld回）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hint (%lld left)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ミスマッチの札が裏返る前なら、直前のめくりをやり直せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before the mismatched cards flip back, you can redo your last pick"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ミスマッチの直後だけ使えます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only available right after a mismatch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ミスマッチを取り消してもう一度選べます。\n無料で使えるのは1回だけです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take back the mismatch and pick again.\nYou get one free undo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今だけ！" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Act now!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに新しいゲームが始まったか、手番が変わったため、戻せませんでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new game started or the turn changed while the ad was playing, so your move couldn't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに新しいゲームが始まったか、札の状況が変わったため、ヒントを出せませんでした。\nヒントの残り回数は減っていません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new game started or the cards changed while the ad was playing, so no hint could be given.\nYour remaining hints weren't used up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
